Yes, it is. These are my parents and my little brother.

3
00:00:06,260 --> 00:00:09,460
Your brother looks very young. How old is he?

4
00:00:09,810 --> 00:00:14,370
He is six years old. He is very active.

5
00:00:14,720 --> 00:00:16,480
That is sweet. Does he like playing outside?

6
00:00:16,829 --> 00:00:19,389
He loves it. We go to the park every weekend.
